  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nYou're Barack Obama. 4 years into your retirement, you awake to find a letter with no return address on your bedside table. It reads \"I hope you've had a chance to relax Barack...but pack your bags and call the number below. It's time to start the real job.\" Signed simply, \"JFK.\" It seemed like an obvious prank. Maybe it was your wife or one of the kids? No one seemed to have any clue about this letter and their reactions seemed genuine. Moreover, how did such a thing make it past your secret service detail? That simply could not be explained. You were the most protected man in the world, after all, no anonymous prank letter would even reach you as everything is checked thoroughly at multiple points just for security reasons. \n\nAt first, you don't think much about it.",
